Hey there! Some great news for every e-sports and multiplayer skirmishes fan - welcome the King Pack DLC for PANZAR, an ultimate team-based fantasy action/RPG! Now it's time to feel the real vibe of the game, to find its most strong points and experience the unparalleled emotions of an epic fantasy combat!

The DLC in question includes:

- SuperVIP account for one year - this means a whole year of 100% chance of success when creating runes or amulets, twice more experience, gold and resources for each fight, a special banner and avatar for one of your characters and 5% experience boost for all of your teammates;

- A complete set of amulets for 30 days - a month of the most effective gameplay ever. Wear the amulets to run faster, hit harder, live longer and level up easier;

- A complete set of eternal potions - no more shortages of Mana, Stamina or HPs. These bottomless bottles will supply you with appropriate elixirs forever;

- A complete set of paints for equipment and armor for one character - make your alter-ego unique and easily recognizable, paint the armor the way you like and enjoy the inevitable fame!

Play PANZAR, win, knock your way to the heights of glory and not be distracted by little things - which have already been taken care of.

