Panzarians,

http://i.imgbox.com/FgTdY9PU.jpg

Here you have the Patch note's of current maintanance

Patchnote's

The amount of time needed for capturing control points on locations "Siege of the Swamp Fort", "Dwarven Quarry" and "The Little Engine That Could" has been changed;
The exact amount of class points for a successful hit of a Tesla-Pole is 0.34;
Also,the following character skills have undergone some changes:
- "Barrel Swap": we changed the aiming principle and the trajectory of shells, the number of which is now equal to 35;
- "Gravity Mine": experience gained is doubled;
- "Flashbang" now costs 15 class points;
- "Steam Hammer" on the first level costs 40 class points, on the second level 20 class points. The armor durability reduced by 25%;
- "Totem": experience gained is reduced by 13%;
- "Mortar": rotation speed is increased by 10%;
- "Berserker Rage": the maximum possible number of stacks on the first level is four, on the second level - seven. Every stack is an increase in the parameters;
- "Crushing blow": damage reduced by 18.3%;
- "Heal": experience gained is reduced by 5%;
- "Restoration": experience gained is reduced by 10%;
- "Winter Cold": experience gained is reduced by 8%.
- Fixed the bug due to which attacks or power attacks sticked after the use of some combined abilities
- - Fixed the bug which caused the "Mortar" to remain visible on a dwarf after he came out of it with ranged weapons
- Fixed the bug due to which long user names were not displayed in the Tab Menu
- Fixed the bug which caused the statistics parameter "position in the team" to be not displayed correctly
- Fixed the bug due to which a Hireling could be functioning while a player's character was still online.

